#: ../../mayavi/docs/source/mayavi/auto/example_magnetic_field.rst:8
#: ../../mayavi/docs/source/mayavi/auto/examples.rst:744
msgid ""
"An example mixing numerical caculation and 3D visualization of the magnetic "
"field created by an arbitrary number of current loops."
msgstr "任意の数の電流ループによって生成された磁場の数値計算と3D可視化を混合した例．"

#: ../../mayavi/docs/source/mayavi/auto/example_magnetic_field.rst:11
msgid ""
"The goal of this example is to show how Mayavi can be used with scipy to "
"debug and understand physics and electromagnetics computation."
msgstr "この例の目的は，物理計算と電磁気計算をデバッグして理解するために，Mayaviをscipyとともに使用する方法を示すことです．"

#: ../../mayavi/docs/source/mayavi/auto/example_magnetic_field.rst:14
msgid ""
"The field is calculated for an arbitrary number of current loops using the "
"corresponding exact formula. The coils are plotted in 3D with a synthetic "
"view of the magnetic_field. A VectorCutPlane is used as it enables good "
"inspection of the magnetic field."
msgstr ""
"フィールドは，対応する正確な式を使用して，任意の数の電流ループについて計算されます．コイルは，magnetic_fieldの合成ビューを使用して3次元でプロットされます．VectorCutPlaneは磁場の良好な検査を可能にするために使用されます．"

#: ../../mayavi/docs/source/mayavi/auto/example_magnetic_field.rst:19
msgid ""
"This example originated from a real-life case of coil design in Python ( "
