"An example of pure TVTK programming to build TVTK objects, which are then "
"added to a Mayavi scene."
msgstr "TVTKオブジェクトを構築し，Mayaviシーンに追加する純粋なTVTKプログラミングの例です．"

#: ../../mayavi/docs/source/mayavi/auto/example_tvtk_in_mayavi.rst:11
