"This example show how pure TVTK objects can be added to a Mayavi scene."
msgstr "この例では，純粋なTVTKオブジェクトをMayaviシーンに追加する方法を示します．"

#: ../../mayavi/docs/source/mayavi/auto/example_tvtk_in_mayavi.rst:13
msgid ""
"This programming style does not allow to benefit from the data-management "
"facilities of Mayavi (the pipeline, the data-oriented mlab functions), but "
"it allows to easily reuse VTK code together with Mayavi or mlab code."
