msgstr "この例では，Mayaviビューをwxフレームに埋め込む方法を示します．"

#: ../../mayavi/docs/source/mayavi/auto/example_wx_embedding.rst:10
msgid ""
"The trick is to create a `HasTraits` object, as in the mlab_traits_ui.py, "
"mayavi_traits_ui.py, or the modifying_mlab_source.py examples "
"(:ref:`example_mlab_traits_ui`, :ref:`example_mayavi_traits_ui`, "
":ref:`example_mlab_interactive_dialog`)."
msgstr ""
